ng", "label": "Salted Scrypt Password Hashing", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "BACKEND_DOCUMENTATION.md", "source_location": "## Persistence and security", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Passwords are hashed with salted scrypt rather than stored in plaintext or with a weaker hash, so the database never stores recoverable credentials."}, {"id": "backend_documentation_session_token_security", "label": "SHA-256 Session Token Hashing + TTL Expiry", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "BACKEND_DOCUMENTATION.md", "source_location": "## Persistence and security", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only a SHA-256 hash of the bearer token is stored (never the plaintext token); MongoDB's TTL index on expires_at automatically removes expired sessions in the background, and expired sessions are also rejected/removed on encounter, limiting exposure if the DB is ever read."}, {"id": "backend_documentation_cors_gap", "label": "Missing CORS Configuration", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "BACKEND_DOCUMENTATION.md", "source_location": "## Deployment considerations", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The application currently has no CORS configuration; documented explicitly as a deployment gap because a browser client hosted on a different origin will need an explicit CORS policy before it can call the API."}, {"id": "backend_documentation_animal_type_filter", "label": "animal_type Field Filter (cow/goat/chicken/duck)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "BACKEND_DOCUMENTATION.md", "source_location": "### POST /generate (table)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "backend_documentation_fastapi_service", "target": "backend_documentation_gemini_api", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 